[[2047,15,0,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The connection \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>D75</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives a supply directly (pin 6)\nfrom the battery via the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or\nof \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99.</p><p>It receives a supply controlled by the ignition\n(INT) (pin 8) via the line for fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the junction unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply with the side lights switched\non reaches pin 7 via the line coming from the switch for the steering\ncolumn switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and protected by the controls illumination\nfuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional fuse\nbox \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99</p><p>Pin 6 of connection  \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>D75</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is earthed,\nwhile pins 9 and 10 provide the signal for the speaker \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P36</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ,\nconnector B, while connector A is for the radio (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234201\">E3510</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>Lastly, pin 1 is connected to the radio \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P20</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (MUTE\nfunction).</p>"]]